two different things.

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.260
Come on over.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.510
This is what they are planning.

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:47.510
In a sense.

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:48.510
It's brilliant.

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:49.510
It's evil.

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:50.870
Genius, I guess, is what I would call it.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:56.260
Weather is going to become a ratings maker
in the sense that it will now be a proud and

00:03:56.260 --> 00:04:03.461
defiant alternative to the fake news weather
that the meteorologists on the Weather Channel

00:04:03.461 --> 00:04:05.410
and elsewhere are giving you.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:11.260
If it weren't so obviously going to work,
it would be worth laughing at.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:15.020
But because it's probably going to work, it's
actually the type of thing we should be crying

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:21.610
over, creating an alternative narrative that
climate deniers can point to and say, no,

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.030
no, no, no, no.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.280
Fox weather has a different perspective on
this.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:32.170
It's extraordinarily dangerous and it will
be launching in a few months.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:38.180
And I am genuinely horrified by what this
what this may do, because remember that there

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:46.140
is a virus in the US, which is people don't
even understand what are facts.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:49.680
And whenever I say that, it sounds like I'm
using strange syntax because people assume

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:52.280
I'm saying people don't understand what the
facts are.

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:53.570
No, no, no, no, no.

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:54.570
It's worse.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:57.120
People no longer understand what are facts?

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:02.060
What types of statement are empirical statements,
statements based on the scientific method,

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:05.320
for example, versus what are just opinions.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:10.210
And when you don't understand what is a fact
and what is an opinion, which is what Fox

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:13.940
News specializes in, all hell breaks loose.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:18.670
Apply that deranged system to weather now.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:22.790
And it is a recipe for absolute and total
disaster.

